<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>GSD — Geosolutions Source Dominicana</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Plataforma oficial de Geosolutions Source Dominicana. Soluciones integrales de agrimensura, ingeniería, asesoría legal e inmobiliaria.">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/img/isotipo.png">
  <style>
    :root {
      --navy: #1A3A52;
      --green: #4A9B6F;
      --green-dark: #3E8A5F;
      --green-l: #E8F4EF;
      --slate: #475569;
      --muted: #94A3B8;
      --border: #E2E8F0;
      --bg-light: #F8FAFC;
      --white: #FFFFFF;
    }
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    body, html {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      height: 100%;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: var(--bg-light);
      font-family: 'Poppins', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
      color: var(--navy);
    }
    .soon-wrapper {
      position: relative;
      height: 100vh;
      height: 100svh;
      width: 100%;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 2rem;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      z-index: 2;
    }
    .soon-bg {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600585154340-be6161a56a0c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=2000&q=80');
      background-size: cover;
      background-position: center;
      transform: scale(1.04);
      animation: slowZoom 24s infinite alternate ease-in-out;
      z-index: 0;
    }
    @keyframes slowZoom {
      from { transform: scale(1.02); }
      to { transform: scale(1.08); }
    }
    .soon-overlay {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92) 0%, rgba(248, 250, 252, 0.85) 50%, rgba(241, 245, 249, 0.94) 100%);
      backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
      z-index: 1;
    }
    .soon-card {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 3;
      max-width: 660px;
      width: 100%;
      background: var(--white);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 3.2rem 2.8rem;
      box-shadow: 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(26, 58, 82, 0.10), 0 4px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03);
      animation: floatUp 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) both;
    }
    @keyframes floatUp {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(24px); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }
    .soon-logo {
      width: 210px;
      max-width: 80%;
      margin: 0 auto 1.6rem;
      display: block;
      object-fit: contain;
    }
    .soon-badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      background: var(--green-l);
      border: 1px solid rgba(74, 155, 111, 0.35);
      color: #2F6B4A;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.14em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      padding: 5px 15px;
      border-radius: 50px;
      margin-bottom: 1.3rem;
    }
    .soon-badge-dot {
      width: 8px;
      height: 8px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--green);
      box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(74, 155, 111, 0.6);
      animation: blink 1.8s infinite;
    }
    @keyframes blink {
      0%, 100% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); }
      50% { opacity: 0.4; transform: scale(0.85); }
    }
    .soon-title {
      font-family: 'Poppins', system-ui, sans-serif;
      font-size: clamp(1.85rem, 4.5vw, 2.45rem);
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--navy);
      line-height: 1.25;
      margin: 0 0 1rem;
      letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    }
    .soon-desc {
      color: var(--slate);
      font-size: 1rem;
      line-height: 1.65;
      margin: 0 auto 2.4rem;
      max-width: 520px;
      font-weight: 400;
    }
    .soon-desc strong {
      color: var(--navy);
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .soon-actions {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 1rem;
      width: 100%;
    }
    .btn-realestate {
      background: var(--green);
      color: var(--white);
      padding: 0.95rem 1.4rem;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.92rem;
      text-decoration: none;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 8px;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
      border: 1px solid var(--green);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(74, 155, 111, 0.25);
    }
    .btn-realestate:hover {
      background: var(--green-dark);
      border-color: var(--green-dark);
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(74, 155, 111, 0.35);
    }
    .btn-crm {
      background: var(--white);
      color: var(--navy);
      padding: 0.95rem 1.4rem;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.92rem;
      text-decoration: none;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 8px;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
      border: 1.5px solid var(--navy);
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(26, 58, 82, 0.05);
    }
    .btn-crm:hover {
      background: var(--navy);
      color: var(--white);
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(26, 58, 82, 0.16);
    }
    .soon-footer {
      margin-top: 2.2rem;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    }
    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .soon-card {
        padding: 2.2rem 1.6rem;
      }
      .soon-actions {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="soon-bg"></div>
<div class="soon-overlay"></div>

<main class="soon-wrapper">
  <div class="soon-card">
    <img src="<%= typeof logoUrl !== 'undefined' ? logoUrl : '/img/logo-gsd.png' %>" alt="GSD — Geosolutions Source Dominicana" class="soon-logo">
    
    <div class="soon-badge">
      <span class="soon-badge-dot"></span>
      Próximamente
    </div>

    <h1 class="soon-title">Estamos preparando nuestra nueva plataforma</h1>
    
    <p class="soon-desc">
      Soluciones integrales de agrimensura, ingeniería legal y bienes raíces de <strong>Geosolutions Source Dominicana</strong>. Accede a nuestro catálogo inmobiliario o ingresa al panel de control CRM.
    </p>

    <div class="soon-actions">
      <a href="https://gsd-bienes-raices.vercel.app" class="btn-realestate" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="m3 9 9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"/><polyline points="9 22 9 12 15 12 15 22"/></svg>
        Ir a Real Estate
      </a>
      <a href="/admin/login" class="btn-crm">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"/><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"/></svg>
        Ir al CRM
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="soon-footer">
      &copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Geosolutions Source Dominicana, S.R.L. · Todos los derechos reservados.
    </div>
  </div>
</main>

</body>
</html>